    "title": "Hines under review by the NCAA - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Sienna Conaghan ,\n7 hours ago The NCAA is currently reviewing Men’s Basketball guard CJ Hines for potential eligibility concerns from circumstances prior to his enrollment at Temple, the program announced Wednesday afternoon. Hines will not participate in any “athletic competition” while the NCAA is reviewing the situation. Hines will not play in Temple’s season-opener... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
